  "description": "Generate C# types from example JSON, CSV, or Parquet data with the dottype command-line tool. Infer nested types and nullability, preserve source field names, and read gzip or Brotli input. Save generated source or pipe it to stdout; generated code has no runtime dependency on dottype. Requires .NET 10.",
